---
// spec: S04 (/board: class chunein), F21-AC8; intent 13 (Ad: Haan)
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import TrustStrip from '../../components/TrustStrip.astro';
import FAQ from '../../components/FAQ.astro';
import AdSlot from '../../components/AdSlot.astro';
import seo from '../../data/seo.json';
import { getProduct, formatPrice } from '../../lib/catalog';

const meta = seo.pages['/board'];
const p = getProduct('board-paper');
const price = p && typeof p.price === 'number' ? formatPrice(p.price) : '';
const classes = [
  { cls: '9th', line: 'Matric part 1 (SSC-I)' },
  { cls: '10th', line: 'Matric part 2 (SSC-II)' },
  { cls: '11th', line: 'Inter part 1 (HSSC-I, first year)' },
  { cls: '12th', line: 'Inter part 2 (HSSC-II, second year)' },
];
const faq = [
  {
    q: 'Paper kis ke liye hai?',
    a: 'Students apni tayyari ke liye, aur teachers aur academies apne class tests ke liye. Paper aap ke chune hue chapters aur kul number ke mutabiq banta hai.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Kya yeh asal board ka paper hai?',
    a: 'Nahin. Yeh board ke pattern par GVS ka banaya hua test paper hai. Asal board papers aur date sheet ke liye apne board ki official website dekhein.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Ek sath kai mazameen ke papers mil sakte hain?',
    a: 'Haan. Har mazmoon ko alag alag order list mein daalein; sab ek hi order mein ja sakte hain.',
  },
];
---
<Base title={meta.title} description={meta.description}>
  <div class="container-page py-6">
    <Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'Board Classes' }]} />
    <h1 class="mt-3">Board Classes: test papers</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-muted max-w-[68ch]">Apni class chunein. Mazmoon, chapters aur kul number aap batayen; board pattern par paper hum banayen. {price && `Qeemat ${price} har paper.`}</p>

    <AdSlot slot="top" />

    <ul class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
      {classes.map((c) => (
        <li>
          <a href={`/board/${c.cls}`} class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 rounded-xl border border-border bg-surface p-4 no-underline text-text hover:border-primary">
            <span>
              <span class="block text-xl font-bold">{c.cls} class</span>
              <span class="block text-sm text-muted">{c.line}</span>
            </span>
            <span aria-hidden="true" class="text-primary text-2xl">›</span>
          </a>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ul>

    <TrustStrip />

    <section class="my-8 max-w-[68ch]" aria-labelledby="how-heading">
      <h2 id="how-heading">Test paper kaise banta hai</h2>
      <p class="mt-3">
        Aap class chunte hain, phir mazmoon likhte hain, kaun se chapters ya units shamil karne hain, aur paper kitne number ka ho.
        Isi ke mutabiq hum board ke pattern par paper banate hain: ek hissa objective (MCQs) ka aur ek subjective (short aur long
        sawal) ka, jaise board ke imtihan mein hota hai.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-3">
        Students yeh paper apni tayyari jaanchne ke liye istemal karte hain: ghar par waqt laga kar paper hal karein, phir kitab se
        jawab milayen. Teachers aur academies isay class test ya monthly test ke liye istemal kar sakte hain, kyun ke chapters aur
        number unhi ki marzi ke hote hain.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-3">
        Order WhatsApp par hota hai aur paper PDF mein aata hai, payment milne ke baad aam taur par 2 ghante mein, kaam ke auqaat
        ke andar. Agar aap ka board ya group mukhtalif hai, ya koi khaas hidayat hai, to order ke baad WhatsApp par bata dein.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-3">
        Behtar nateeje ke liye chhote papers se shuru karein: pehle do teen chapters, phir har mahine pichhle chapters mila kar.
        Imtihan ke qareeb poore syllabus ka paper asal waqt laga kar hal karein, aur jahan number kate un hisson ko dobara parhein.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-3">
        Yeh GVS ka banaya hua practice paper hai, asal board paper nahin. Date sheet, roll number aur results ke liye apne board ki
        official website dekhein. Job tests ki tayyari ke liye <a href="/job-prep">Job ki tayyari</a> aur saari qeematein
        <a href="/plans">rate list</a> par hain.
      </p>
    </section>

    <FAQ items={faq} />
    <AdSlot slot="bottom" />
  </div>
</Base>
